  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans:\r\rMarket Set up and pack away plan\rIndicative Layout\rLocation Plan\rBlock Plan\rHERITAGE STATEMENT\r\rReason: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper planning.\r",
    "Notwithstanding the provisions of the Town and Country Planning (Use Classes) Order 1987, or any amending Order, the premises outlined under the Indicative plan shall only be used as a market on a Sunday between the prescribed hours as per condition 3 and shall not be used for any other purpose within Use Class D1, or any other purpose.\r\rReason: To enable the local planning authority to fully consider the effects of development normally permitted by these orders and in the interests of protecting the residential amenity of adjoining occupiers to comply with adopted Development Management Policies.\r",
    "The market shall only operate between the hours of 10:00 to 15:00 on Sundays and no setting up or dismantling of stalls shall take place outside the hours 07.30 - 18:00. \r\rReason: To safeguard the amenities of the occupiers of nearby residential properties.\r\r",
    "The total number of individual stalls shall not exceed 24 at any one time.\r\rReason: In the interests of highway safety and residential amenities.\r",
    "That the operation of the market shall be in accordance with the details outlined within the Market Set up and pack away plan.\r\rReason: In the interests of highway safety\r",
    "All stalls, gazebos and structures shall be temporary and removed at the end of each trading day.\r\rReason: In the interest of the visual amenity within the street. \r"
  ],
